    "6. Drag curl on the Smith machine (forces correct form): grip just outside the hips, slide the bar up along the body while driving the elbows back. Great for the long head and peak.",
    "7. Dumbbell preacher curl: don't let the shoulders roll forward or shrug at the bottom (he says 90% of people do). Full extension, start neutral and supinate at the top. Drive the elbows down into the pad for mind-muscle connection.",
